{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 18, :comments ["<b>Riches and honor</b> — עתק (ʿataq): the meaning is thickness and strength. So too: 'זָמַם יָצָא עָתָק מִפִּיךָ.'" "<b>And righteousness</b> — in place of, in the sense of success. And so it is possible to interpret 'וְצֶדֶק מִשָּׁמַיִם נִשְׁקָף.'"], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 8, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:21:27.562444858Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}